n: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-08-28/26106_1.jpg\" alt=\"image2.jpeg\" id=\"2A04945B-337D-41E0-8FF0-F0E02A5C96C7\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>髪の毛<rt>かみのけ</rt></ruby>をアップにしました😆✌🏻</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">THE<ruby>浴衣<rt>ゆかた</rt></ruby>ヘア！これがしっくり<ruby>来<rt>き</rt></ruby>ますね～</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あんまり<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>れてなくて<ruby>全身<rt>ぜんしん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>がなくてすみません…<ruby>帯<rt>おび</rt></ruby>はオレンジ<ruby>色<rt>しょく</rt></ruby>です！&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>自分<rt>じぶん</rt></ruby>で<ruby>着付<rt>きつ</rt></ruby>けました(&nbsp;¯﹀¯&nbsp;)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【3<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あ！<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>りわすれてたぁ（泣）</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"